# Quenched spectroscopy with clover: 16^3 x 32, beta=6.0, kappa=0.150, c_sw=1.769
# Non-perturbative clover coefficient for beta=6.0 (Luscher et al.)

-------------------------------
[Lattice]
-------------------------------
nX: 16
nY: 16
nZ: 16
nT: 32

-------------------------------
[Gauge Action]
-------------------------------
Beta: 6.0
Update Method: heatbath
Metropolis Epsilon: 0.2
Start Type: hot

-------------------------------
[Monte Carlo]
-------------------------------
Thermalization Sweeps: 2000
Number of Configurations: 200
Sweeps Between Measurements: 20
Overrelaxation Sweeps: 5
Configuration Save Frequency: 10
Save Binary Configs: on
Random Seed: 76543

-------------------------------
[Measurements]
-------------------------------
Measure Wilson Loops: off
Wilson Loop R Max: 4
Wilson Loop T Max: 8
Measure Polyakov: on
Measure Correlators: on
Measure Action Density: off
Measure Wilson Flow: on
Flow Step Size: 0.01
Max Flow Time: 2.0
Verbose Output: off

-------------------------------
[Wilson Fermions]
-------------------------------
Kappa: 0.150
Wilson r: 1.0
CG Max Iterations: 10000
CG Tolerance: 1.0e-12
Solver Type: bicgstab
Clover Coefficient: 1.769

-------------------------------
[HMC]
-------------------------------
MD Steps: 20
MD Step Size: 0.01
HMC Trajectories: 100
